# Database and Viewer Enhancement Walkthrough

## Overview

Successfully enhanced the Coolkonyha database and viewer with notes, images, expandable rows, and a new professional dark color scheme.

## Changes Implemented

### 1. Database Schema Enhancements

#### Migration Script

**File:** [scripts/migrate_add_notes_images.js](file:///d:/dev/coolkonyha-solo-vibe/scripts/migrate_add_notes_images.js)

Added new columns to database tables:

| Table | New Columns |
|-------|-------------|
| `customers` | `notes` (TEXT), `logo_path` (TEXT) |
| `product_suppliers` | `notes` (TEXT), `logo_path` (TEXT) |
| `products` | `notes` (TEXT), `image_path` (TEXT) |
| `orders` | `notes` (TEXT) |

**Execution:**
```bash
node scripts/migrate_add_notes_images.js
```

✅ **Result:** All columns added successfully to database

---

### 2. Enhanced Seed Data

**File:** [scripts/update_seed_data.js](file:///d:/dev/coolkonyha-solo-vibe/scripts/update_seed_data.js)

Updated all existing records with:
- **Realistic business notes** for customers, suppliers, products, and orders
- **Image/logo paths** (placeholder paths for future image assets)

#### Sample Notes Added:

**Customer Example:**
> "Premium restaurant client. Prefers eco-friendly products. Regular orders monthly. VIP customer with 15% discount on bulk orders."

**Product Example:**
> "Professional-grade German steel. Includes 5 essential knives. Lifetime warranty. Ergonomic handles. Comes with wooden storage block."

**Order Example:**
> "Customer requested gift wrapping for knife set. Delivery completed on schedule. Customer very satisfied, expects repeat order next month."

**Execution:**
```bash
node scripts/update_seed_data.js
```

✅ **Result:** 5 customers, 3 suppliers, 10 products, and 5 orders updated with notes

