### 4. Enhanced HTML Viewer

**File:** [index-db.html](file:///d:/dev/coolkonyha-solo-vibe/index-db.html)

#### Key Features:

**🎨 Dark Theme Design**
- Professional dark blue background
- High contrast coral accents
