- Expandable rows show:
  - Supplier notes
  - Logo path (placeholder)
  - Website and contact details
  - Registration date

**🍳 Products View**
- Expandable rows show:
  - Product specifications (notes)
  - Image path (placeholder)
  - Supplier ID
  - Registration date

**📋 Orders View**
- Expandable rows show:
  - Order notes
  - Complete item breakdown
  - Full status history timeline
  - Order dates and updates

