## Technical Implementation

### CSS Features
- CSS custom properties (variables) for easy theme management
- Smooth transitions on all interactive elements
- Responsive grid layout for detail sections
- Timeline component for order history

### JavaScript Features
- Event-driven row expansion
- State management for expanded rows
- Smooth scroll to expanded content
- Dynamic content generation
- API integration for all data

