## Future Enhancements

### Image Management (Next Phase)
Currently, the viewer shows image/logo paths as placeholders. To implement actual images:

1. Create `public/assets/logos/` directory
2. Create `public/assets/products/` directory
3. Add actual image files
4. Update paths in database to real file locations
5. HTML will automatically display images when paths are valid

### Suggested Next Steps
- [ ] Add file upload functionality for images/logos
- [ ] Implement image storage in `/public/assets/`
- [ ] Add image preview on hover
- [ ] Create image gallery for products
- [ ] Add bulk image upload capability
- [ ] Implement image compression and optimization

